• Writes to Immutable System Audit Trail (BLOCKED)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEE2E2;strokeColor=#DC2626;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;shadow=0;arcSize=6;" parent="f2" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="160" width="380" height="90" as="geometry" ></mxGeometry></mxCell>
      <mxCell id="p2_val" value="4. Valid Pass: Load Profile
